# .linksignore — links the checker should skip.
#
# Format:  <pattern>    # reason
#   * matches anything, the pattern is also matched as a plain substring.
#   Always put the reason after " # " — maintainers review these.
#
# Use this file only for links that are alive but refuse automated clients
# (Cloudflare, login walls) or for pages that are intentionally offline
# (archived projects kept for historical reasons).
#
# Examples (not active):
#
# https://example.com/*                        # Cloudflare blocks automated clients, verified 2026-10
# https://old-tool.example.org                 # site is offline, kept because the source is mirrored on GitHub

# --- verified exceptions -----------------------------------------------------

https://godotshaders.com*   # site is alive (verified 2026-10), but its WAF answers automated clients with a non-standard 454
